---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_check_results: resultsPublished == true
    q_check_results --> q_check_not_supplied: tokens not already supplied
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_calc_total: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + tokenFees
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: askToken.transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_transfer --> q_mark_supplied: tokensSupplied = true
    q_mark_supplied --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not published
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert_dup: already supplied
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: totalRequired includes allocated tokens plus fee tokens
        INV-002: tokensSupplied transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-003: supplyTokens is prerequisite for withdrawRaisedCapital
    end note
